WEBVTT

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:03.290
Yoshii.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:04.130
Yes!

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:05.460
Summon.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:11.880
As he is the Punishment Bearer, Akihisa
Yoshii's Being is used for special purposes.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:17.520
It possesses prodigious strength in addition to being corporeal.

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:19.770
Bring me the world map.

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:20.890
Fine.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:23.930
Thus, he is treated as the teachers' gofers.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.530
Yoshii, take the tables to the auditorium.

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:29.060
What?

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:32.160
Yoshii, take down the soccer goal.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:35.660
Why do I always have to do it?

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.160
You're the Punishment Bearer, remember?

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.050
Dammit, this pisses me off!

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:47.300
The pain that the Bearer's Being feels will be transmitted back to its owner.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:52.470
There's a quiz coming up. Make sure you review the material.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.100
I'll <i>review</i> you!

00:00:58.840 --> 00:00:59.900
Stupid.

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:11.760
Something that grows when its alone, What is it?

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.040
One more chance, One more chance!

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:14.420
Never, Never give up!

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:15.720
One more chance, One more chance!

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:17.020
Never give up!

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:30.150
Meeting with someone else is easy

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:32.920
I decided what to say before they even asked

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:35.530
My heart beats fast thinking if I passed or not

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:37.710
I can't panic in this fight for love

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:40.780
Study! Study! Study! Keeps me up all night

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:43.410
I've got a dreaming genius inside me

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.990
I'd be great if everyone's wishes came true

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:48.160
I won't care about other people's lives

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:51.120
Perfect-area complete!

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:53.750
I'll definitely be waiting for you!

00:01:53.750 --> 00:02:00.150
I can hear your voice from the Perfect-area!

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:01.460
Ah! Ear! Ear!

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:04.730
Why? Why can't stop when I pass you

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:07.340
if I'm your counselor

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:09.930
"Are we friends?" Yes, we're friends."

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:11.930
But, I failed the test with a 0

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:15.240
No! I'll take it again! and again!

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.380
I'm serious. One more chance, please

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:21.850
There's something better for is in the future

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:27.940
Better than my life right now.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.240
Fourth Period
Love and Spice and Boxed Lunches

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:35.350
Today is Sunday, but...

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:35.710
Fourth Period
Love and Spice and Boxed Lunches

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:36.940
That's it for today.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:39.770
Be sure to study at home.
Supplementary Lessons

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:41.160
Okay.
Supplementary Lessons

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:45.540
It may be the weekend, but class F is
required to take supplementary lessons.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:49.080
By the way, Yoshii... What happened to your clothes?

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:51.470
Well... I went to <i>review</i>...

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:53.410
And you got your ass kicked, right?

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:57.150
Man, I'm hungry.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:01.110
I'm particularly hungry today, since I was forcibly enslaved and all...

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.980
Your Being seems like it would be pretty convenient to have, but I guess not, huh?

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:08.620
Yuuji, lunch.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.320
Shouko? Why are you here?

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:12.190
You guys don't have lessons today, right?

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:14.770
I came to do a little self-studying.

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:17.070
I don't care if it's Sunday as long as you're here.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:18.240
You don't need to come.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.860
I won't come if you won't come, even if it's a school day.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:23.000
That's a problem.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.260
You brought your own lunch today, right, Akihisa?

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:28.540
The hell's that?

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.700
1/67th of a cup ramen.

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.210
1/67th?

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:36.320
Half of half of half of half of half of half.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.880
That's 1/64th, dude.

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:41.500
Man, you suck at fractions.

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:45.640
Stuff's not bad.

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:46.820
Man, I feel sorry for you.

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:48.470
I'd be bawling if that were my lunch.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:54.440
V-very well! I'll just have to share my lunch with you.

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:55.060
Really!?

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.690
I made too much and forgot to take it out.

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.640
I guess it'd be a waste to trash it, so you want it?

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:00.030
Hell yeah!

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.710
One sec.

00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:03.880
Where is it?

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:07.990
Sorry, I left it at home.

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:09.120
Gimme a break...

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:12.540
God, and I spent all that time on it...

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:13.330
Don't worry.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:17.990
It's my bad. I almost believed that you had
done something feminine for a second there!

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:20.210
...and my neck is going to break!

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:23.170
I told you! I forgot to bring it!

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:24.090
A-almost...

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:26.760
Double Eye Poke!

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:28.890
Don't look.

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:34.030
These guys never quit.

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:38.940
Excuse me... is this class F, the one full of idiots?

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:41.440
What are you doing here, Hazuki?

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:42.900
Sis!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.120
Hazuki...

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:46.490
Oh, Mr. Stupid!

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:51.330
Nice work, Akihisa. I had no idea the entire country knew you were such a dumbass.

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:52.580
Couldn't it just be the neighborhood!?

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.750
Awesome! You really are Mr. Stupid!

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.880
Hold on... Why do you know Aki, Hazuki?

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:02.170
He's my husband.

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:06.140
I'm going out with him because we're going to get married!

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:11.390
Akihisa had indeed met Hazuki before.

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:14.020
We'll explore the details later.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:17.650
What the hell, Aki? What have you done to my sister!?

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:20.320
Time for an inquisition.

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:23.030
What are you doing!?

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:29.730
Defendant Yoshii Akihisa is charged with breaking the FFF's blood pact.

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:33.450
He perpetrated a felony by going out with a girl.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:35.420
No objections, correct?

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:36.930
Correct.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.220
Defendant, any last words?

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:42.900
Shouldn't my defense come before my last words!?

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.340
Verdict is guilty. Death penalty.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.540
What grade are you in?

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:48.400
Fifth.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:50.680
You're way more mature than Akihisa.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:53.130
Oh, Miss Pretty over there!

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:54.770
Hello, Hazuki.

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:58.160
So why did you come here today?

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:58.900
Oh yeah!

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:01.020
Here you go! You left this at home.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:04.770
My lunches! Thanks a ton, Hazuki.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:08.330
Good thing you brought both of them...

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:10.510
See? I wasn't lying.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:13.040
I know how to cook.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:15.080
Oh, I see what's going on.

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:21.220
I was wondering why you were acting so serious
first thing in the morning. You even woke up early.

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:22.000
You wanted to make-

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:26.190
What are you talking about?

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.930
She's a little strange...

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:31.790
Oh, so you made a lunch especially for Akihisa.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:35.470
No way! I'd die before I did that!

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:38.120
Then what exactly where you acting so serious over?

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:40.410
Well, not lunch, that's for sure!

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:42.350
It's that thing! A model!

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:43.400
A model?

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.770
The 1:35 King Tiger!

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.870
A German heavy tank...

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:49.450
You're in luck, bro.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:52.340
It's bigger than your 1/64th of a cup ramen.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:53.410
Does that matter?

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:55.100
Yeah, looks like this will work.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:56.950
It's inorganic! It's inedible!

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:00.540
Anyway, Akihisa, I just made too much.

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:02.380
I definitely didn't go out of my way for you!

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:05.700
What's the matter, Himeji?

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.400
Nothing.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.260
That's a boxed lunch.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:11.220
Oh, Himeji brought one too.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:14.730
Yeah, but I don't think it's any good...

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:26.940
Actually... I made this for you!

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:29.770
Yoshii, I'd be really happy if you ate it!

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:33.490
Time for an inquisition.

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:35.620
Dude, wait!

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:37.080
Verdict is guilty. Death penalty.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.580
You're not even giving me a chance to speak this time!?

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:41.540
Wait! This isn't what you think!

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.300
Well...

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:47.580
Umm...

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:50.140
It's not like that.

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:55.790
This lunch is, umm...

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:01.990
Torture him first, then kill him.

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:04.710
It's hot! Hot! Hot!

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.020
Sis?

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:15.480
Jerk.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.890
Are you okay?

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:32.120
Right as rain. I can endure any
hardship in order to eat your cooking.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:34.270
Aww, shucks...

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:38.650
No one can interrupt us here.

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:39.480
I guess.

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:43.990
Whoa, this looks awesome!

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:45.420
I wouldn't say that...

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:49.690
Oops, I forgot the drinks. Hold on.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:58.130
Himeji is cute, smart, and great at cooking.

00:08:58.130 --> 00:08:59.750
You don't deserve this.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:02.420
What the hell, Yuuji!?

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:04.300
Let me have some too.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.470
You too!?

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:09.760
Hey, man, we're just having a few bites-

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:13.810
Yuuji!?

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:16.400
Hideyoshi!

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:17.950
What happened?

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.160
This ain't good, Voyeur!

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:20.020
We've gotta get these guys to the nurse's-

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:23.220
Voyeur!?

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:27.260
The food can't be...

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:31.510
No way. It looks so good.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.430
That was close.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:54.160
I almost got taken through the gate.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.340
There's no mistaking it.

00:09:57.340 --> 00:10:00.380
The food is the reason why everyone fainted.

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:02.860
Smelling it was bad enough...

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:04.830
A-Akihisa...

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.080
Hideyoshi!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:09.600
Can you... Can you bring me a plate?

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:10.520
Plate?

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:13.280
They say you might as well swallow
the plate if you're eating the poison...

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:19.470
So I'll be fine if I swallow a plate...

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:21.920
Damn it, his cognitive ability is leaving him!

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:24.450
I brought some drinks.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:25.650
Himeji...

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:28.810
What happened to them?

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:32.340
Well, they got a little tired after eating, so they took a nap.

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:36.750
If you take a nap right after you eat you'll turn into a cow.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:39.390
I'd rather be a living cow than a dead human.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:42.340
Here you go.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.180
Thanks...

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:51.340
Crap. What should I do?

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:55.350
You'll hurt her feelings if you don't eat it. Tough it out.

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:57.290
Stop. You're gonna fuck yourself up something good if you eat that.

00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:58.280
You'll be fucked.

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:00.850
What, are you suicidal?
You'll hurt her feelings if you tell her the truth.

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:03.280
You're not going to eat?

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:06.660
Well, uh... it's just so beautiful, I can't bear to eat it!

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:08.580
I'm asking you if you're suicidal, man.

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:11.350
Am I imposing on you?

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:14.970
No way! I'm so glad you went to all this trouble for me!

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:17.680
So don't go any further than the thought.
It's the thought that counts.

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:19.100
Thank goodness.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:24.100
Do you try your own cooking when you cook?

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:27.540
They say you'll get fat if you do that.

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:29.670
Besides...

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:30.650
Besides?

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:35.570
I wanted you to be the first person to try it.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:38.830
My fate is sealed.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:40.300
You have no choice but to die.
You have no choice but to eat it.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:43.040
Why are my super-ego and id agreeing with each other!?

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:44.740
Akihisa...

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:45.520
Yuuji!

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:46.880
Sakamoto?

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:50.430
I'm sorry, Himeji. Could you get me a drink?

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:53.030
I want some oolong tea.

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:54.460
Sure.

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:57.470
Yuuji!

00:11:57.470 --> 00:12:02.320
Akihisa, I want you to listen to what I have to say.

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:06.650
Spices have been used to cure poison since the olden days.

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:08.400
Before the refrigerator was invented,

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:11.530
they were used as disinfectants in order to aid food preservation.

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:17.320
And they say that a girl's love is the strongest spice in her cooking.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:19.490
Wait... That means...

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:21.430
Yes, that's right.

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:25.340
Use the spice named love to cure the poison.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:26.290
I see.

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:27.590
Thanks, Yuuji.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:31.070
This is a test!

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:32.010
Don't worry.

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:35.490
I'm prepared to cast my life away for the sake of love.

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:41.070
As long as I have the spice called love, no matter what the poison...!

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:54.950
Love can't cure poison.

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:57.410
You're my hero, Akihisa.

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:58.550
RIP.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:02.260
What happened to Yoshii?

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:05.060
He got sleepy after eating.

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:07.830
You'll turn into a cow if you
take a nap right after you eat.

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:13.470
By the way, where's Shimada?

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:19.480
After all the time I spent on this...

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:22.220
I should have just been honest.

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.700
Man, I wasn't expecting that at all.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.600
I never thought Himeji could
actually be bad at something.

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:35.070
I'm even more hungry now...

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:36.820
Aki...

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:38.740
Mr. Stupid!

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:41.010
Hazuki.

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:43.610
Have you seen my sister?

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:46.550
Actually, I haven't...

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.240
What happened to lunch?

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:54.690
Some stuff happened that prevented me from retaining the calories.

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:56.760
You must be hungry, then!

00:13:57.990 --> 00:14:00.970
I should've asked Minami for her lunch...

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.530
My sister's?

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.140
Yeah.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:08.630
I wonder what she made. Man, I really want to try it.

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.460
All right.

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:13.970
Aki, the boxed-

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:15.360
Let's have lunch together, Sissy!

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:16.850
Miharu!?

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:18.030
I've been looking all over for you!

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:21.660
I want you to try the special lunch I made just for you!

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:24.040
Why the hell are you here!?

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:24.950
Class D doesn't have lessons today!

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:27.770
I don't care if it's Sunday as long as you're here!

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:30.000
I won't come if you won't come, even if it's a school day!

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.250
Why does our school have so many retarded kids who can't think normally!?

00:14:33.860 --> 00:14:37.260
Enjoy this fabulous moment with me!

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:39.810
Stop following me!
Let's go look over there.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:40.620
Let's find an empty place to sit down and have lunch.

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:42.640
Buzz off!

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:42.910
Let's find an empty place to sit down and have lunch.

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:53.560
Gosh, she's just too shy.

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:55.610
Sissy! Sissy!

00:14:58.150 --> 00:14:59.790
Jesus Christ...

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:04.000
Whatever, I need to go find Aki...

00:15:18.630 --> 00:15:21.050
Charge, Haiseiko!

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:25.260
Faster!

00:15:25.260 --> 00:15:28.060
No running in the halls.

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:34.270
Aki... Thank god.

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:36.020
I'll make sure he takes it this time!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.550
Just as we thought.

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:42.770
That bastard!

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:46.060
He had two chicks make him lunch!

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:48.020
This is inexcusable!

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:50.440
Traitors must be lynched.

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:52.090
Traitors must be lynched!

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:54.370
No! You're getting the wrong idea!

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:56.410
You're getting the wrong idea...

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.620
Well... Umm...

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:02.880
Uhh...

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:09.310
Dude, wait! Hang on! Stop!

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:12.090
You guys are out of your fucking minds!

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:17.940
What the hell is wrong with me?

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:20.930
Charge, Haru Urara!

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:22.890
Full speed ahead!

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:26.130
No running in the halls.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.050
We're outside right now.

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:30.370
I've had just about enough for one day...

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:31.790
I'll make sure...

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:33.080
Aki.

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:34.820
Minami?

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:35.620
Sis!

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:40.220
Mr. Stupid was playing with me!

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.420
That's nice.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:43.050
Just don't harass him too much, okay?

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:45.430
Hey, Aki.

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:49.400
Have you had lunch yet?

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:52.470
Well... I guess it could go either way...

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:53.570
Really?

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:56.650
Well, umm...

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:02.780
If you're hungry, umm...

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:05.020
I...

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:05.740
I?

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:08.070
I... I...

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:14.010
What's Oshamanbe's specialty?

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:18.090
Huh?

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:19.750
Shit!

00:17:20.110 --> 00:17:23.420
Oshamanbe's specialty is hair crabs.

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:24.740
Kubo!

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:28.510
Are you here for some self-studying? It's Sunday, you know...

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:30.730
Class F has supplementary lessons...

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:34.350
You haven't eaten lunch yet?

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.590
Not really...

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:38.910
Why don't we eat lunch together?

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:40.960
I'm kinda broke...

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:46.060
Dearie me. Guess I'll have to pay for you.

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:47.450
Hell yeah! Let's do this!

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:50.520
Catch you later, Shimada.

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:55.600
While we eat, let's come up with
some strategies for the midterms.

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:56.770
Midterms?

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:05.010
Hazuki, have you eaten lunch yet?

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:09.190
Oh, I forgot to since I was busy playing...

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:11.950
Hey, you need to get your vitamins.

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:13.140
Don't you wanna get big and tall?

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:16.030
I thought this was for Mr. Stupid...?

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.740
Yeah right. Like I'd cook something for that loser.

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:20.230
I made it for you.

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:22.570
Let's eat it together then!

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:32.300
Oh, I'm sorry. I forgot that I still have lessons.

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:33.790
Why don't you go home first?

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:35.840
All right!

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:50.210
I guess I'll take the A set.

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:55.390
Or should I get the B set since it's cheaper?

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:57.560
Oh, Yoshii.

00:18:58.590 --> 00:19:00.260
Mr. Fukuhara.

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:01.600
Great timing.

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:03.820
I can't open this.

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:06.900
Could you summon your Being to help me open it?

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:08.640
Sure thing.

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:10.980
Summoning Being...

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:11.940
Summon!

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.490
Open up!

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:28.050
Those who were KIA are assigned supplementary lessons!

00:19:28.050 --> 00:19:29.690
What!?

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:34.470
Wait a second! I still haven't had anything to eat!

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:35.050
Because you're a dumbass.

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:37.180
He's such a cutiepie.
Because you're a dumbass.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:41.770
What am I saying?

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:43.940
Allow me to dig in.

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:04.680
That jerk! That dumbass!

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:06.590
He's the biggest greatest hugest jerk in the world!

00:20:06.590 --> 00:20:09.430
Who the hell would make lunch for him!?

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:11.150
Jeez!

00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:20.310
Jerk.

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.200
Glass, Cans, Plastic Bottles
Other

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:46.240
Hold your horses!

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:52.010
Aki?

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:55.220
Are you going to throw that away?

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:01.710
Why?

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:03.420
Well, uhh...

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.360
Let's see...

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:09.900
You shouldn't waste the food like that!

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:12.320
Huh?

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:16.500
If you waste food, global warming will kill us all.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:19.040
And karma will come for you.

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.850
And, uh, I guess you can consider this recycling in an environmental sense...

00:21:21.850 --> 00:21:25.840
I feel that we need to take great care with how we use nonrenewable resources.

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:34.510
Here.

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:38.020
Want it?

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:42.450
You don't?

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:48.460
I'll take it then.

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:50.230
Remember to cherish your resources-

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:55.740
Minami...

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:03.620
Stupid.

00:22:09.400 --> 00:22:18.470
Baka, go go home!

00:22:18.760 --> 00:22:21.740
It's a time of peace now that school's out

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:23.290
If I were to compare her

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:24.830
"She's a real angel!"

00:22:24.830 --> 00:22:27.800
Then a sudden note ruined my fun

00:22:27.800 --> 00:22:29.190
It said I have a makeup test!

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:30.580
It's hell!

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:33.920
I was joking with my friends,

00:22:33.920 --> 00:22:36.950
"There's no way someone is that stupid!"

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:40.030
But deep down inside,

00:22:40.030 --> 00:22:41.320
I was screaming,

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:44.280
"That was me! I'm that stupid!"

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:50.860
I thought the "Monthly" sign in the parking lot

00:22:50.860 --> 00:22:56.140
was the company's name!

00:22:56.140 --> 00:22:58.890
For the longest time...

00:22:59.590 --> 00:23:02.590
Stupidity is a manly character

00:23:02.590 --> 00:23:05.290
Is that our lack of common sense?

00:23:05.290 --> 00:23:08.600
Rules are useless in this world

00:23:08.600 --> 00:23:11.600
Eat Korean BBQ every night and overthrow the masses!

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:13.240
Look!

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:17.810
The sun that rose from the west is now setting down.

00:23:17.810 --> 00:23:20.850
Run! It's almost dinner time.

00:23:20.850 --> 00:23:27.720
Let's go home!

00:23:35.750 --> 00:23:36.870
Question five:

00:23:36.870 --> 00:23:41.640
What's the name of the sport that requires a map and compass to reach a checkpoint?

00:23:41.640 --> 00:23:42.970
RPG!

00:23:42.970 --> 00:23:44.830
I knew that would be your answer.

00:23:44.830 --> 00:23:47.310
Next episode: Maps and
Treasures and Striker Sigma V.

00:23:47.310 --> 00:23:49.360
This will be on your test.
